The perception stack, BEV encoder, transformer modules and much of the
training scaffolding under projects/mmdet3d_plugin/ and tools/ derive from
those projects. Modifications made here are described in README.md and
docs/experiments.md, and are concentrated in:

  projects/mmdet3d_plugin/VAD/VAD_head.py
  projects/mmdet3d_plugin/VAD/VAD.py
  projects/mmdet3d_plugin/LAW/VAD_LAW.py

VAD and LAW in turn build on MMDetection3D, MMDetection, MMSegmentation and
MMCV (OpenMMLab), also Apache License 2.0.
